{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0314_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0314_story_intro_1000_null", "source_sha256": "70eb6ba0894e0dd112b8d70989218817dd42eb5223dba3a46f054de390513b42", "ja": "＜テキスト非表示＞", "zh": "＜不显示文本＞", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0314_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0314_story_intro_1001_null", "source_sha256": "a984b40130bcd9f26aa8b5cf42e64a5bdd8c69138f0cf1143be3a0f844571af2", "ja": "■「ここまでのあらすじ」画面内表示■", "zh": "■“前情提要”画面内显示■", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0314_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0314_story_intro_1002_null", "source_sha256": "f8c401fb9d5c24113b4f8c94b02fa7b7f4ea85f8d17f6cd037b2bf07e92cb406", "ja": "Team4th、ミーティングの日……", "zh": "Team4th，开会之日……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0314_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0314_story_intro_1003_039kon", "source_sha256": "e957f2c2f0216831f05a38c770b66cd0e96e5bf124a79235b73226753b980dbb", "ja": "よし、遅刻者も欠席者もなし！\nTeam4th、みんな揃ってるわね。", "zh": "好，既没人迟到也没人缺席！\nTeam4th，大家全都到齐了呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0314_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0314_story_intro_1004_038chz", "source_sha256": "152f10504d7764f4455e9ce120fc78bffdd7be1997843129cc652df32de2e647", "ja": "ええ、全員準備万端、気合いも十分ですわ。\nこうしてわたくし達が集められたということは……。", "zh": "是的，所有人都已准备就绪，干劲也十足。\n既然把我们召集到这里，也就是说……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0314_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0314_story_intro_1005_037nao", "source_sha256": "50f33393c5fd42b63c00f7436bc2dc8665ea4008564f48f8833cba8a5a30b368", "ja": "そう！\n私らTeam4thに、新しいオファーがきたらしいで！", "zh": "没错！\n听说我们Team4th接到了新的邀约！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0314_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0314_story_intro_1006_049mom", "source_sha256": "640142a304e66d848bbf647e2b1fb55de08adc700f4b946afa1c94b5af53c17c", "ja": "オファーが……、あ。\nそんなこと、どうして奈緒さんがしってるの？", "zh": "听说有新工作……啊。\n这种事，奈绪姐怎么会知道？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0314_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0314_story_intro_1007_037nao", "source_sha256": "9b7f48e28d8f47da02da04fe98291a5cc823172cb62eb76b0b2135524ebfe77d", "ja": "ふっふっふ。さっき事務室の前通りかかった時にな、\nなんやそれっぽい言葉が聞こえてきてん！", "zh": "哼哼哼，我刚才路过办公室门口时，听到了些像是那回事的话！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0314_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0314_story_intro_1008_038chz", "source_sha256": "412c42d005ca60e6ed115f867a4aa536c3729fbf895cd9f3d4a03d2dae5add9a", "ja": "まぁ。盗み聞きでしたのね？", "zh": "哎呀，原来你是在偷听呀？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0314_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0314_story_intro_1009_037nao", "source_sha256": "c041fd4b765c2545e2ca10ce12290c0d9706cfd2908a468851ed9138c0d69099", "ja": "不可抗力っちゅーやつやな。", "zh": "这就叫不可抗力啦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0314_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0314_story_intro_1010_028ari", "source_sha256": "92ee04b73221bd7665cf38bd2b4bee425438658529383553e59777f11ed71cc9", "ja": "これは……やはり、デビューイベントで爆誕した\n『アイドル探偵桃子ちゃん』のドラマ化なのでは！？", "zh": "这……果然是把在出道活动上横空出世的《偶像侦探桃子》改编成电视剧了吗！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0314_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0314_story_intro_1011_049mom", "source_sha256": "116cdc61e13660dacdb3b8166ca0830141847041e90d97cd49fb1fbea0c301dd", "ja": "どうかな……。\n亜利沙さんが作ったMVからのお話かも。", "zh": "不一定吧……\n也可能是从亜利沙小姐制作的MV发展出来的故事。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0314_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0314_story_intro_1012_025roc", "source_sha256": "bae89f9bdb1be0a2c7db8c6bbfb74887d6198d8ff9792ba392b336d0a376f404", "ja": "MVもインプレッションを伸ばしてます。もしかしたら\nロコアートへのオファーかもしれません♪", "zh": "MV的展现量也在不断增加。说不定\n是向ROCO的艺术发来的工作邀请呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0314_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0314_story_intro_1013_038chz", "source_sha256": "5f089fb06fdc51e40f0137be408d0e8ab766e4d9ba3fb25072e6c2957dea2a0f", "ja": "ふふ、夢が広がりますわね。このみさんは、\nどういったお仕事がいいとか、ご希望はありまして？", "zh": "呵呵，真是让人浮想联翩呢。请问，您对什么样的工作比较中意，有什么希望吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0314_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0314_story_intro_1014_039kon", "source_sha256": "ea175d395c16f0630d909157d086fd55afdaaa00228fa3d9da3bfe54543f2105", "ja": "デビューしたばかりだもの、どんなお仕事でも大歓迎！\nでも、希望を言っていいなら、やっぱり……。", "zh": "毕竟才刚出道，无论是什么工作我都非常欢迎！\n不过，要是可以说说希望的话，果然还是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0314_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0314_story_intro_1015_null", "source_sha256": "db1ed45a1bc0472ed71bc5d1969f1d6660d1bdfe8929f5c6d936faf21babc89a", "ja": "ガチャ", "zh": "（开门声）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0314_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0314_story_intro_1016_401pro", "source_sha256": "511a9b5988873b068b916d1d669d391af36a0dba8c4a0c4f8c61cdf7cd2bfb84", "ja": "みんな、おまたせ！\nなんだか賑やかだけど、どうか……。", "zh": "大家久等了！\n虽然感觉挺热闹的，不过还请……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0314_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0314_story_intro_1017_049mom", "source_sha256": "f97290131f834c0810ec81a00d628937b588d1358ad7e8d20038fd2897ebfd03", "ja": "遅いよ、お兄ちゃん！　桃子たちはもう準備できてるん\nだから、早くオファーのお話聞かせて！", "zh": "太慢了，哥哥！桃子她们都已经准备好了，快点告诉我这个委托是什么！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0314_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0314_story_intro_1018_025roc", "source_sha256": "8d69112c55e806eb10710d26f10267cbbc36f1353f8703c141c2bba3dcaf2038", "ja": "ロコはどんなインスタレーションでもオッケーです！\nさあ、すぐキックオフしましょう！", "zh": "ROCO什么样的装置艺术都没问题！\n来，马上开始吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0314_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0314_story_intro_1019_401pro", "source_sha256": "d2b575ad6eede25a676d02fd3da9152bf5d8f62020c1891200eb2e4befa698a3", "ja": "す、すごい勢いだな……。\nというか、どうしてオファーのこと知ってるんだ？", "zh": "这、这气势也太强了吧……\n话说回来，你是怎么知道邀约的事的？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0314_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0314_story_intro_1021_401pro", "source_sha256": "d291fe261fe374a57d45e94aa5b90ebb086c75a124839eda3999b728194e5c09", "ja": "？　……まあ、モチベが高いに越したことはないか！\nよし、じゃあ早速ミーティングを始めよう！", "zh": "？……不过，干劲十足总归是好事！好，那就马上开始会议吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0314_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0314_story_intro_1022_401pro", "source_sha256": "6e81acb0edca66314947aee155928b51583dd859a19740ef463496249da5cc42", "ja": "じつは、みんなのデビューイベントでお世話になった\n遊園地から、改めてオファーをもらったんだ。", "zh": "其实，曾在大家的出道活动中给予过帮助的游乐园，又再次向我们发来了邀约。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0314_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0314_story_intro_1023_038chz", "source_sha256": "64a0e7275a6e77aa02150e1c4ce8484ff9333ea7613d53333d1592c9e8c86c37", "ja": "まぁ、あの遊園地から？", "zh": "哎呀，是那家游乐园吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0314_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0314_story_intro_1024_039kon", "source_sha256": "cdbea366dc87fe83940879aa87fd980e1543e4764b28fcdc91d9beeb56337e08", "ja": "！　まさか……！", "zh": "！难道……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0314_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0314_story_intro_1025_401pro", "source_sha256": "e7eb9bece088646929a322a5307a03f14933f1caa8dcd20d17184060d6303635", "ja": "あの時はトラブルで使えなかった、\nメインステージでのライブだ！", "zh": "就是那时因为出了问题而没能用上的、\n主舞台上的演出！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0314_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0314_story_intro_1026_039kon", "source_sha256": "af911098e64fee299d7c4497cd43e467b5f6955999e691fc5091501de917b453", "ja": "ライブ……できるのね！", "zh": "可以……举办演唱会了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0314_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0314_story_intro_1027_401pro", "source_sha256": "7bf0179b4dc4603ca36b8d06219f99e8bd2b442c397409bf8aa1dc1ab77eeac4", "ja": "はい。先方も気合い入ってるみたいで、「今度こそ最高\nのステージを用意します！」って言ってくれました。", "zh": "是的。对方似乎也干劲十足，还对我们说：“这次一定会准备最棒的舞台！”", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0314_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0314_story_intro_1028_401pro", "source_sha256": "5a82b31cbc31127b82d50a3901ea2b1dd760d6688e9b5bd8e95a8031ef44b679", "ja": "物販スペースも広めに確保してもらえたから、CDや\nタオルとか、グッズ系も大きく展開する予定だ！", "zh": "销售区域也争取到了比较大的场地，所以CD、毛巾之类的周边商品也打算大规模展出！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0314_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0314_story_intro_1029_028ari", "source_sha256": "0ed50e9aba14a362ce2ace8d06fe6166632142088f38990ea83b146f2f64a29d", "ja": "物販にも配慮してもらえるとは、わかってますね！\nさすがアイドルイベントの聖地です！", "zh": "连周边销售都考虑到了，真懂行啊！\n不愧是偶像活动的圣地！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0314_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0314_story_intro_1030_401pro", "source_sha256": "6856d2d7217809f791b0427912d11ed035f7991a7b5a8cd4cab0bde60a607f22", "ja": "即興劇やMVのドラマの評判で、注目が集まってる\n今こそ、アイドルとしての魅力を見せつけてほしい。", "zh": "因为即兴剧和MV短剧的口碑，大家都开始关注起来了。  \n现在正是展现偶像魅力的时候，希望你们能让大家好好见识一下。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0314_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0314_story_intro_1031_401pro", "source_sha256": "b6b95f3a053527e09a9fae5193701a5e59a6d22d7436aa7e87f6b30fc91256b3", "ja": "……みんなの、\n歌とダンスのステージで真っ向勝負だ！", "zh": "……用大家的\n歌舞舞台堂堂正正一决胜负吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0314_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0314_story_intro_1032_039kon", "source_sha256": "bcbb0c0bdd3967ccaa7d15c63a2d76a0fb0dcd4aef7eac48a24a2d111fa334a1", "ja": "歌とダンスのステージ……。\nええ、そうよね！　やっぱり私たち、アイドルだもの！", "zh": "歌与舞蹈的舞台……。\n没错，就是这样！我们毕竟是偶像嘛！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0314_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0314_story_intro_1033_037nao", "source_sha256": "25d53bacd767c964bef246c66fe9cc9cc6109cf2d1c852933188483052c8afa5", "ja": "望むところやな！　数々の試練を乗り越えてきた私らの\nチームワークも見せつけたるわ！　な、桃子♪", "zh": "正合我意！我们经历了重重考验磨砺出来的\n团队协作，也让他们见识见识！对吧，桃子♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0314_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0314_story_intro_1034_049mom", "source_sha256": "6c78993626ff8b00073a6283ad12d0560ea9b375fb3884eb842c05ae37dbca7d", "ja": "も、桃子はプロとして、ちゃんとお仕事するだけだよ。\n……それに、数々って言うほどじゃないでしょ！", "zh": "桃、桃子作为专业人士，只要好好完成工作就行了。  \n……而且，也没经历那么多考验吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0314_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0314_story_intro_1035_025roc", "source_sha256": "6aa3583a35c555d232d86f619a3e27f8ac1fb5d546a97a3d10e200185004df43", "ja": "メインステージにはポテンシャルを感じてました。\nリベンジできるなら、ウェルカムです！", "zh": "我一直觉得主舞台很有潜力。\n要是能一雪前耻，当然欢迎！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0314_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0314_story_intro_1036_038chz", "source_sha256": "bb9fd8ed1e36a44be191587524ca2e3c2f0334a807e6c63eeba387a98f5601f4", "ja": "コロちゃんの言う通りですわ。みなさん、わたくし達の\nデビューステージ、取り戻しにまいりましょう！", "zh": "正如CORO所说。各位，我们去夺回我们的出道舞台吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0314_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0314_story_intro_1037_025roc", "source_sha256": "f44c1c017a352d8454e284826f17e4534f3a7cff6314baf9056e796b9a7e0198", "ja": "チヅル……今の言い方、とってもクールです～！\nでもロコはロコです！", "zh": "千鹤……刚才那种说法，超酷的～！\n不过ROCO是ROCO！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0314_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0314_story_intro_1038_401pro", "source_sha256": "10f845f0354516b6f3e763bc23cf183d0ab6f379633e72d6fb7cf0f1444bd563", "ja": "よし！　俺もリベンジってわけじゃないけど、\n今度こそちゃんと同行して、全力でサポートする。", "zh": "好！虽说我也不是为了雪耻，\n但这次我一定会好好随行，全力支援你们的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0314_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0314_story_intro_1039_401pro", "source_sha256": "bfa72badd6e073ff49db64e125404b04c3f71d503bca3913420f85c0c6846b09", "ja": "みんなで一丸となって、\nメインステージライブ、成功させよう！", "zh": "大家齐心协力，\n一定要让主舞台演出圆满成功！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
